The IPTV window (M3U playlists, Xtream Codes player_api.php, XMLTV now/next,
and catch-up / timeshift URLs) is part of this fork. It does not vendor a
third-party IPTV client. Catch-up URL shapes follow the public M3U and Xtream
conventions documented by Kodi's pvr.iptvsimple addon. That addon's source is
not included here. Optional movie and series gap-fill talks to TMDB's HTTPS
API with a key the user types in Settings. No TMDB client library and no
artwork are vendored.
